claim.claim-text:
(a) selecting an eddy current brake configuration as claimed in any one of the above claims;
(b) applying a driving force to cause varying relative movement between the magnetic field and the at least one electrical conductor (4); and
(c) by causing movement, making the at least one electrical conductor (4) and magnetic field interact thereby inducing eddy current drag forces and acting to resist relative motion between the magnetic field and the at least one electrical conductor (4).
